+++++
+++++### **Repair Attempt 2**: Add Greeks Enrichment to Alpaca Path
+++++**File**: `financial_dashboard/tabs/options_lab/data_loader.py`
+++++**Function**: `fetch_options_chain_alpaca()` return block
+++++**Lines**: ~176-183
+++++
